#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:8
msgid "用 CMake 接入平台"
msgstr "Integrate the platform with CMake"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:10
msgid ""
"一个应用维护自己的 CMake 工程和 `assembly.toml`。源码检出和安装 Source SDK "
"使用相同接口；先选择工具链，再创建平台，最后创建镜像。"
msgstr ""
"An application maintains its own CMake project and `assembly.toml`. A source"
" checkout and an installed Source SDK use the same interface: select the "
"toolchain, create the platform, then create the image."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:13
msgid "三个公开入口"
msgstr "Three public entry points"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "调用"
msgstr "Call"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "责任"
msgstr "Responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "`find_package`"
msgstr "`find_package`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "检查所选来源，加载公开函数；不解析装配、不创建生产目标"
msgstr ""
"Validate the selected source and load public functions; do not resolve an "
"assembly or create production targets"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "`nexus_add_platform`"
msgstr "`nexus_add_platform`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "解析一个 TOML，生成静态实例，创建所选平台目标"
msgstr ""
"Resolve one TOML, generate static instances and create selected platform "
"targets"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "`nexus_add_firmware`"
msgstr "`nexus_add_firmware`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:0
msgid "为镜像连接启动对象、链接布局、产物及资源检查"
msgstr ""
"Attach startup objects, link layout, artifacts and resource checks to an "
"image"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:30
msgid ""
"工具链必须在 `project()` 前通过 preset 或命令行选定。每个构建目录只有一个 工具链和装配；不同板卡、后端或 SDK "
"使用独立目录。同一装配可创建多个镜像。"
msgstr ""
"Select the toolchain through a preset or the command line before "
"`project()`. Each build directory has one toolchain and one assembly. Use "
"separate directories for different Boards, backends or SDKs. The same "
"assembly may create multiple images."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:33
msgid "选择源码或安装 SDK"
msgstr "Select source or an installed SDK"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:35
msgid ""
"源码检出的 `Nexus_DIR` 为 `<nexus>/cmake`，安装 SDK 为 `<prefix>/lib/cmake/Nexus`。以 "
"ARM 源码工程为例，从应用目录执行："
msgstr ""
"For a source checkout, `Nexus_DIR` is `<nexus>/cmake`; for an installed SDK,"
" it is `<prefix>/lib/cmake/Nexus`. For an ARM source project, run from the "
"application directory:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:45
msgid ""
"`NEXUS_SOURCE` 在这里是命令示例中的路径变量。平台公开选择入口为 `Nexus_DIR`， 不要求应用设置平台开发测试或 workload"
" 开关。普通配置不下载依赖；先按 [源码准备](source-checkout.md)完成所选任务的准备。"
msgstr ""
"Here `NEXUS_SOURCE` is a path variable in the example command. The public "
"platform selection entry is `Nexus_DIR`; applications do not need platform "
"development-test or workload switches. Ordinary configuration does not "
"download dependencies. First complete the selected task preparation in "
"[source preparation](source-checkout.md)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:49
msgid "连接应用库与组件"
msgstr "Connect application libraries and components"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:51
msgid "下面的示例要求装配已选择 `log`；用这些库和镜像声明替换前面的镜像声明："
msgstr ""
"The example below requires the assembly to select `log`; replace the earlier"
" image declaration with these library and image declarations:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:59
msgid ""
"`Nexus::Platform` 提供所选公开接口及生成头的使用要求。组件负责自己的公开和私有 依赖，应用不添加厂商 SDK 或 provider "
"私有目录。只需要 ABI 的自建目标可连接 `Nexus::ABI`；已选 OS 后端通过 `Nexus::OS` 连接，不拼接内部目标名。"
msgstr ""
"`Nexus::Platform` supplies usage requirements for selected public interfaces"
" and generated headers. Components own their public and private "
"dependencies; applications do not add vendor SDK or provider-private include"
" paths. A custom target needing only the ABI may link `Nexus::ABI`. Link the"
" selected OS backend through `Nexus::OS`, without constructing internal "
"target names."

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:63
msgid "独立 CPU 工程"
msgstr "Standalone CPU projects"

#: ../../../../../../docs/guides/cmake-consumption.md:65
msgid ""
"只消费 Core、Arch、公共 I/O 和 OS 的独立 CPU 工程使用 [CPU Runtime 接入](cpu-"
"runtime.md)。发现与装配合同及失败后的产物责任见 [构建合同](../explanation/build-model.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Independent CPU projects consuming only Core, Arch, public I/O and OS use "
"[CPU Runtime integration](cpu-runtime.md). The [build "
"contract](../explanation/build-model.md) defines discovery, assembly and "
"artifact responsibility after failure."
